[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0010","text":"结束了……！\n做到了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0020","text":"嗯\n坚持到最后，做得很好，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0030","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0040","text":"终于……\n可以回去了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0043","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0060","text":"……甜花，怎么了？\n果然是累了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0070","text":"没、没有……\n没事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0080","text":"绯田小姐……自主练习……做了好多……\n我想起来了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0090","text":"但是……\n甜花……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_03_0100","text":"果然还是……家里好……呢……"}]
